{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1234567890, "method": "Controller.1.harakiri"}', 'The device should come back online successfully if reboot was configured.', '60a5655f-0d0e-4fcd-be99-21b5092171f4', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.987256', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.987258');
INSERT INTO test_step (id, step_name, step_description, expected_result, script_id, created_date, updated_at) VALUES ('639d1117-fa4a-4108-b3b9-bf2258f81b61', 'Validate device resource usage state', 'Check the activation state of the DeviceInfo plugin and activate it if needed, then validate that the device CPU and memory usage are within the acceptable range before proceeding.
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "Controller.1.status@DeviceInfo"}', 'Device CPU and memory usage should be within the expected range, confirming the device is in a healthy state before testing.', '60a5655f-0d0e-4fcd-be99-21b5092171f4', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.988097', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.988098');
INSERT INTO test_step (id, step_name, step_description, expected_result, script_id, created_date, updated_at) VALUES ('e6e69866-fd0e-401f-aa0e-07017e7153c3', 'Verify and activate required plugins', 'Retrieve the current activation state of org.rdk.DownloadManager, org.rdk.AppPackageManager, and org.rdk.AppManager. Activate any plugin that is not already in the activated state.
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "Controller.1.status@org.rdk.DownloadManager"}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "Controller.1.status@org.rdk.AppPackageManager"}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "Controller.1.status@org.rdk.AppManager"}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "Controller.1.activate", "params": {"callsign": "<plugin_name>"}}', 'All three required plugins should be in the activated state before test execution proceeds.', '60a5655f-0d0e-4fcd-be99-21b5092171f4', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.988900', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.988901');
INSERT INTO test_step (id, step_name, step_description, expected_result, script_id, created_date, updated_at) VALUES ('f0d0c62f-e4d8-4efd-ba7a-7f7639a6fac8', 'Subscribe to onAppInstalled and onAppUninstalled events', 'Register a WebSocket event listener to subscribe to both the onAppInstalled and onAppUninstalled events from org.rdk.AppManager. Wait 3 seconds after registration.
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "org.rdk.AppManager.1.register", "params": {"event": "onAppInstalled", "id": "client.events.1"}}

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "org.rdk.AppManager.1.register", "params": {"event": "onAppUninstalled", "id": "client.events.1"}}', 'Both event subscriptions should be established successfully and the WebSocket event listener should be active.', '60a5655f-0d0e-4fcd-be99-21b5092171f4', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.989123', '2026-08-06 04:32:42.989124');
INSERT INTO test_step (id, step_name, step_description, expected_result, script_id, created_date, updated_at) VALUES ('fce8f6b1-9167-4f70-92b9-d147fb052049', 'Check if application is pre-installed and uninstall if present', 'Query the installed package list to check whether com.rdkcentral.google is already installed. If present, uninstall it and wait for the onAppUninstalled event before starting the iteration loop.
