2. import selenium module
3. Start selenium hub in TM machine
4. Start Node in wlan client machine
5. Connect client to 5GHZ SSID
6. Try to access the WEBUI of the gateway using selenium grid
7. Validate if the UI page is accessible or not
8. Try to login to the page with credentials
9. Validate if login is success or not
10. Kill selenium hub and node
11. unload module', 'The UI page of gateway should be accessible from WLAN cleint and should be able to login to it successfully', 'd1fac41a-5a8f-4b6f-a624-90eb00e70948', '2026-07-30 09:25:14.472974', '2026-07-30 09:25:14.472975');
