2. Get the current TxRx Rate List value
3. Set the TxRx RateList with private AP''s and it should be sucess
4. Revert back the original value
5. Unload the module', 'Should be able to enable TxRxRate telemetry marker for Private WiFi APs', '50408f87-0c77-4527-83b7-e605cfb85e99', '2026-07-31 10:00:47.425843', '2026-07-31 10:00:47.425844');
