CheckPoint 3:
TestManager GUI will publish the result as PASS in Execution/Console page of Test Manager', 'acfc7038-473d-4565-80e1-06517142ee32', '2026-07-29 09:11:09.734706', '2026-07-29 09:11:09.734707');
