2.Retrieve the NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS and NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT config values from Device config file.
3.Construct the mediapipelinetests command based on the retrieved testcasename, NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS deviceconfig value and timeout
