3. Set the firewall level to Low using tdkb_e2e_SetMultipleParams
3. Login to the LAN client and get the IP address assigned by the gateway
4. Try to connect to Wifi client and check whether the wifi client is connected to the DUT
5. From the wlan client, do FTP to the LAN client and check whether FTP is success when the firewall level is set to Low
6. Revert the firewall level to original value
7.Unload tdkb_e2e module', 'From the wlan client, do FTP to the LAN client and check whether FTP is success when the firewall level is set to Low', 'c9b3c93e-96f8-42a9-b4cf-ccce7701778c', '2026-07-29 10:24:39.109335', '2026-07-29 10:24:39.109336');
