18. Unload the modules', 'The inbound traffic is not let through even if  correctly triggered when PT rule is disabled.', 'b536d924-5c51-45d7-ba1e-0d18f9386aca', '2026-07-30 08:12:48.145801', '2026-07-30 08:12:48.145802');
