11. Kill selenium hub and node
12. unload module', 'The firewall level from dmcli output should be same as that from UI page', 'ebed9980-7380-43c0-9abc-f3d1a8107509', '2026-07-30 09:29:38.995054', '2026-07-30 09:29:38.995056');
