5. Revert to initial lanmode if required.
6. Unload the modules', 'The WiFi SSID statuses should be "down" when DUT is set to bridge-static mode.', '9f0281c4-d809-4644-8ae1-a05429a960e2', '2026-07-31 10:05:55.821809', '2026-07-31 10:05:55.821810');
