15. Delete the added port triggering rule
16. Revert Device.NAT.X_CISCO_COM_PortTriggers.Enable if required
17. Revert the SSID, KeyPassphrase and Radio Enable to initial values.
18. Unload the modules', 'Port Triggering rule in GW should take effect so that an inbound packet with target port 5001 is not forwarded to the WLAN machine (which is running an IPERF server) after it sends an outbound packet through the GW that triggers the out of range port 12350 which is not configured in the rule using UDP protocol.', '3f258c6a-ed4c-4a71-869d-159ef5289174', '2026-07-30 08:30:32.153579', '2026-07-30 08:30:32.153580');
